      "possibleRetry": false,
      "inputTokens": 74,
      "outputTokens": 522,
      "costUsd": 0.004735,
      "pronunciationText": "Find the probability that X is more than one and at most two. That's F of two minus F of one, four ninths minus one ninth, which is one third. The probability that X is more than two is one minus four ninths, which is five ninths. And the probability that X equals two is zero, because X is continuous."
    },
