      "inputTokens": 57,
      "outputTokens": 404,
      "costUsd": 0.0036645,
      "pronunciationText": "Two short lines to remember. First, points carry nothing, and intervals carry the probability. Second, between a and b, take F of the bigger end, minus F of the smaller end. If you ever get a negative answer, you've subtracted the wrong way round."
    },
